Dialogue: 2,0:00:05.18,0:01:41.40,Header,,0,0,0,,H005  •  第5文型 [SVOC]
Dialogue: 2,0:00:05.18,0:00:10.10,English,,0,0,0,,My father brought home a small puppy.
Dialogue: 2,0:00:10.10,0:00:18.28,English,,0,0,0,,Mother decided to adopt her, and we named her Sora.
Dialogue: 2,0:00:18.28,0:00:22.82,English,,0,0,0,,Sora looked anxious at first.
Dialogue: 2,0:00:22.82,0:00:31.90,English,,0,0,0,,Father declared her a member of our family, and we all welcomed her.
Dialogue: 2,0:00:31.90,0:00:35.70,English,,0,0,0,,Mother found her gentle.
Dialogue: 2,0:00:35.70,0:00:42.14,English,,0,0,0,,I considered her a good companion.
Dialogue: 2,0:00:42.14,0:00:51.16,English,,0,0,0,,Within a few days, she began to feel that our house belonged to her too.
Dialogue: 2,0:00:51.16,0:00:54.72,English,,0,0,0,,I promised to protect Sora.
Dialogue: 2,0:00:54.72,0:00:58.40,English,,0,0,0,,She trusted us in return.
Dialogue: 2,0:01:00.04,0:01:08.94,English,,0,0,0,,Father said, Let us accept this dog as family, and we embraced her together.
Dialogue: 2,0:01:12.80,0:01:20.84,English,,0,0,0,,After a few weeks, our care had made her a calm and contented dog.
Dialogue: 2,0:01:24.06,0:01:41.20,English,,0,0,0,,Sora became the curious, affectionate heart of our home, and she carried a warm bond into every heart.
